#. type: Title #
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Contributing to the Quarkus.io website"
msgstr "为Quarkus.io网站贡献力量"

#. type: Plain text
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Contributions are welcome, please submit pull requests for the `main` branch.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Important:** the guides are maintained in the main Quarkus repository and pull requests should be submitted there:\n"
"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/tree/main/docs/src/main/asciidoc.\n"
msgstr ""
"**重要：** 指南保存在主Quarkus仓库中，合并请求应该提交在那里：\n"
"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/tree/main/docs/src/main/asciidoc.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Please see the README for instructions on [running the site locally](https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkusio.github.io/#running-locally) and [contributing a blog](https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkusio.github.io/#writing-a-blog).\n"
msgstr ""
